{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, grab, check properties, perform task. If not found, move, scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = Task1    /> <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Action ID = ScanForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = ObjectFound    />",
